      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.direction.cassim-bell.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.asset.sprite.cassim-bell",
        "actorId": "cassim-bell",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前夜祭の晩も、無限遺失物保管庫の窓口は開いていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りは、落とし物の書き入れ時だ。カシム・ベルは、今夜も窓口にいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いたが——去年までと、決定的に違うことが一つある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓口の脇に、砂時計が置いてあるのだ。休止札と、対の道具だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「十五分の休止を、取るようになったんです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "七十二時間、働き続けていた人の、これは革命だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ちょうど、次の休止です。ご一緒に」砂時計が、返された。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "保管庫の奥、七世界の落とし物の谷の縁に、二人ぶんの椅子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "巨大竜の靴が、今夜も良い衝立になっている。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "十五分の中身は、贅沢だった。紅茶が二杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日の決勝の話が三分。くだらない話が五分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "沈黙が四分——この人との沈黙は、保管庫の棚みたいに、静かで、整っていて、居心地がいい。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "残り、二分。彼は紅茶を置いて、居住まいを正した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさん。私の十五分には、決まりがあります」「十四分は、誰と過ごしてもいい」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……最後の一分だけは、非公開、という決まりです」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "残り、一分。彼は、窓口係の白手袋を、初めて外した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "素手が、私の手を、そっと包んだ。耳が、かあっと熱くなる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「非公開の一分は——これからも、あなたのぶんです」砂時計の砂が、静かに落ちていく。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "砂が落ちきって、彼は手袋を戻し、窓口係の顔に帰った。「明日、勝っても負けても、ここへ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「落とし物も、拾い物も、勝敗も——受け付けますので」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この窓口、何でも受け付けすぎだ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、手のひらに、まだ一分ぶんのぬくもりが残っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "落とし物にしないように、ポケットに入れて、帰った。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.cassim-bell.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
